{
  "_readme": [
    "Mars (M12 step 5f): scenes/merrimack.json BY COPY with two values changed -- scene.planet,",
    "and the orbit view's altitude, 2.1 * 3389500 = 7117950 m, which is 2.1 radii OF THIS PLANET",
    "and is exactly what the flag path has always stood at (app/Options.cpp evaluates that",
    "function for --planet mars). By copy and not by `base`, because `base` is a declared key of",
    "the resolved document and a `base` line would change what `gagame --planet mars",
    "--print-scene` prints -- the identity this file exists to keep. The shim maps `--planet mars`",
    "with no scene file named to this file, so a Mars launch is a scene file like every other.",
    "Mars declares no page tenant and no paint row (M12 step 4c), and the estuary sections below",
    "are inert there; they are kept so the two documents differ in exactly the two keys that are",
    "the planet."
  ],
  "scene": {"name": "merrimack", "mode": "world", "planet": "mars", "view": "sea"},
  "include": [
